 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "LORD lead me in your righteousness",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Make your way straight before me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "There is nothing trustworthy in their mouth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Within them is destruction",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their throat is an open grave",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With their tongues they flatter",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Declare them guilty God",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let them fall by their own schemes",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But let all who take refuge in you rejoice",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Let them sing for joy forever",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Spread your shelter over them",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Let those who love your name exult in you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For you have rebelled against him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Drive them out for their many transgressions",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the righteous find a steady rest",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the presence of the Lord",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But let all who take refuge in you rejoice",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let them sing for joy forever",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Spread your shelter over them",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let those who love your name exult in you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You surround them with favor",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As with a shield",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The blessing of the LORD rests",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Upon the righteous heart",
